e (90 min)', 'This powerful healing and energizing massage uses pressure point, kneading and friction techniques to release deep muscle tension.', 290000, 'IDR', 0), ('Lymphatic Massage', 'Lymphatic Drainage Massage (75 min)', 'Our Lymphatic Drainage Massage uses the Vodder technique, a specialised approach that stimulates the lymphatic system, reduces inflammation and water retention, and enhances the immune system.', 410000, 'IDR', 0), ('Reflexology', 'Foot Reflexology (30 min)', 'This foot therapy focuses on the feet to positively affect the whole body. Reflexology works on precise points on the feet that are believed to ‘reflex’ to other parts of the body.', 130000, 'IDR', 0), ('Traditional Massage', 'Therapeutic Massage (105 min)', 'Is there any specific area on your body where you feel the most pain? Maybe just your back or your legs?', 360000, 'IDR', 0), ('Body Scrub', 'Coconut Body Scrub (45 min)', null, 190000, 'IDR', 0), ('Facial', 'Oxygen Facials by Intraceuticals - Rejuvenate Anti-Ageing Oxygen (60 min)', 'This skin quenching treatment provides the ultimate in intense hydration. Perfect for all skin types.', 1250000, 'IDR', 0), ('Balinese Boreh', 'Balinese Boreh Body Wrap (90 min)', 'Experience an authentic, century old Balinese Boreh energising treatment that is still used today as a health remedy.', 440000, 'IDR', 0), ('Body Wrap', 'Seaweed Body Wrap (135 min)', 'This oxygenated body exfoliation enhances the penetration of seaweed minerals.', 650000, 'IDR', 0), ('Cream Bath', 'Hair Cream Bath by Loreal (60 min)', 'Enjoy one of these traditional and lavish Indonesian hair treatments.', 250000, 'IDR', 0), ('Waxing', 'Eyebrow Waxing (15 min)', null, 160000, 'IDR', 0), ('Waxing', 'Upper Lip Waxing (5 min)', null, 135000, 'IDR', 1), ('Waxing', 'Full Face Waxing (30 min)', null, 475000, 'IDR', 2), ('Lashes', 'Russian Volume Full Set Eyelash Extensions (120 min)', null, 625000, 'IDR', 0), ('Lashes', 'Natural Full Set Eyelash Extensions (120 min)', null, 59500